		(property "Description" "I2C breakout: GND / 3V3 / SDA / SCL. 3.3 V ONLY, in either direction - a Pi fitted in the socket drives this pin, and SDA/SCL are hard-wired to its GPIO2 and GPIO3, which are not 5 V tolerant. Feed it 3.3 V from an external master and the two LM75s run at that level"
