		(property "Description" "2x20 2.54 mm MALE header for a 40-way ribbon to a Raspberry Pi. The Pi is not part of the assembly and JLCPCB does not supply it. Pin numbering is straight through, so a standard ribbon maps board pin n to Pi pin n - watch the pin 1 marker, because a plain header can be plugged on either way round and reversed puts 5 V on GPIO2. The same holes take a shrouded DC3-40P box header if you would rather have the key; there is clearance for the shroud"
			(at 660.4 381 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)

