		(property "Description" "Pi supply branch fuse, 1.5 A hold, on the 12 V side of the buck. The Pi's 1.4 A peak at 5 V is only 0.67 A here, so this is not sized for the Pi - it is sized to open on a shorted module, which is the fault that would otherwise sit across the 30 A bus unprotected"
