		(property "Description" "User EEPROM at 0x50 on i2c-1, clear of the LM75s at 0x48 and 0x49. NOT a HAT ID EEPROM: the Pi's firmware reads that only on ID_SD/ID_SC, pins 27 and 28, which this socket leaves unconnected, so there is no overlay and no HAT detection - read it with i2cdump -y 1 0x50. WP is tied low so it can be flashed in place; it runs from the Pi's own 3V3, so it is simply absent without a Pi"
			(at 850.9 330.2 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)

